dark:border-violet-500/30\">State Tax</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">May 26, 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-600 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors line-clamp-2 mb-1.5\">Illinois Income Tax Guide 2026</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\">Everything you need to know about Illinois income tax in 2026, including the flat tax rate, personal exemptions, and how it compares to neighboring states.</p><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">illinois</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">income tax</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">flat tax</span></div></a><a class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-card p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all\" href=\"/blog/florida-vs-texas-tax-comparison\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 dark:bg-cyan-500/20 dark:text-cyan-400 border-cyan-300 dark:border-cyan-500/30\">Comparison</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">May 26, 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-600 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors line-clamp-2 mb-1.5\">Florida vs Texas Tax Comparison</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\">A detailed comparison of the tax structures in Florida and Texas — two of the most popular no-income-tax states for relocation.</p><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px